  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Fishing Sector in Northern Mozambique for Gender-Inclusive Programming to Counter Violent Extremism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will promote stable communities and counter violent extremism in communities affected by the conflict and receive significant numbers of returnees by supporting the fishing sector, which is vital to livelihoods and economic stability in Cabo Delgado. The project will support fishing-related livelihoods, community-based projects prioritized by fishers and relevant associations, and support to the Government of Mozambique (GoM) to counter violent extremism through capacity development of the fishing sector in northern Mozambique, with a focus on supporting women and youth in the industry including but not limited to inclusive socioeconomic development and alternative livelihood options for youth.</narrative>
  </description>
